t-move","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Tell me if you see the light move.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"빛이 움직이면 말씀해 주세요.","transliteration":"bee-chee um-jee-gee-myun mal-ssum-hae ju-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-look-nose","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Look at my nose.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"제 코를 보세요.","transliteration":"jay koh-rul boh-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-double","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Do you see two of me?","linked_terms":[],"translation":"제가 두 명으로 보이세요?","transliteration":"jay-ga doo myung-u-roh boh-ee-say-yo?","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vis-worse-direction","field":"eye","stage":"eye-acuity","english":"Is it worse looking this way?","linked_terms":[],"translation":"이쪽을 볼 때 더 심한가요?","transliteration":"ee-jjoh-gul bol ttae duh sim-han-ga-yo?","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-pup-shine","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pupils","english":"I am going to shine a light in your eyes. Please look at the wall behind me.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"눈에 빛을 비추겠습니다. 제 뒤의 벽을 보세요.","transliteration":"nu-nay bee-chul bee-choo-ge-ssum-ni-da. jay dwee-ay byuh-gul boh-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-pup-dont-look-light","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pupils","english":"Do not look at the light. Keep looking far away.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"빛을 보지 마시고 멀리 보세요.","transliteration":"bee-chul boh-jee ma-shee-goh mull-lee boh-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-pup-both-open","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pupils","english":"Keep both eyes open.","linked_terms":[],"transla