ual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-iop-check","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pressure","english":"I am going to check the pressure in your eye.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"안압을 측정하겠습니다.","transliteration":"ah-nap-ul chuk-jung-ha-ge-ssum-ni-da","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-iop-no-hurt","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pressure","english":"This does not hurt. You will feel a light touch on your eye.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"아프지 않습니다. 눈에 살짝 닿는 느낌이 있습니다.","transliteration":"ah-pu-jee an-ssum-ni-da. nu-nay sal-jjak dan-nun nu-kkee-mee it-ssum-ni-da","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-iop-still","field":"eye","stage":"eye-pressure","english":"Please look straight ahead and hold still. Try not to blink.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"정면을 보고 움직이지 마세요. 눈을 깜빡이지 마세요.","transliteration":"jung-myun-ul boh-goh um-jee-gee-jee ma-say-yo. nu-nul kkam-ppa-gee-jee ma-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vf-fix","field":"eye","stage":"eye-fields","english":"Keep looking at my nose, not at my hand.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"제 코를 계속 보세요. 손을 보지 마세요.","transliteration":"jay koh-rul gay-sok boh-say-yo. soh-nul boh-jee ma-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vf-raise","field":"eye","stage":"eye-fields","english":"Raise your hand when you see my fingers.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"손가락이 보이면 손을 드세요.","transliteration":"son-ga-ra-gee boh-ee-myun soh-nul du-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-vf-count","field":"eye","stage":"eye-fields","english":"How many fingers do you see now?","linked_terms":[],"translation":"지금 손가락 몇 개 보이세요?","transliteration":"jee-gum son-ga-rak myut gae boh-ee-say-yo?","