ose","field":"eye","stage":"eye-drops","english":"Please close your eyes.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"눈을 감아 주세요.","transliteration":"nu-nul ga-ma ju-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-drp-no-rub","field":"eye","stage":"eye-drops","english":"Don't rub your eyes.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"눈을 비비지 마세요.","transliteration":"nu-nul bee-bee-jee ma-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-slit-chin","field":"eye","stage":"eye-slitlamp","english":"Chin on the rest, forehead against the bar.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"턱을 여기에 대고 이마를 여기에 붙이세요.","transliteration":"tuh-gul yuh-gee-ay dae-goh ee-ma-rul yuh-gee-ay boo-chee-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-slit-open","field":"eye","stage":"eye-slitlamp","english":"Open your eyes wide.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"눈을 크게 뜨세요.","transliteration":"nu-nul ku-gay ttu-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-slit-no-pull-back","field":"eye","stage":"eye-slitlamp","english":"Don't pull your head back.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"머리를 뒤로 빼지 마세요.","transliteration":"muh-ree-rul dwee-roh ppae-jee ma-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-slit-bright","field":"eye","stage":"eye-slitlamp","english":"The light is bright. Please bear with it.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"빛이 밝습니다. 조금만 참아 주세요.","transliteration":"bee-chee bak-ssum-ni-da. joh-gum-man cha-ma ju-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"draft","reviewed_on":"","comment":""},{"id":"eye-slit-ear","field":"eye","stage":"eye-slitlamp","english":"Look at my ear.","linked_terms":[],"translation":"제 귀를 보세요.","transliteration":"jay gwee-rul boh-say-yo","translator":"Eyelingual","reviewer":"","status":"dr